#[ Stable ]

---[ Setting ]---

```tm
@version
@meta
@config
@setting
@kind
@blueprint
@vocabulary
```

---[ Expression ]---

```tm
@heading     | #
@list        | - -.
@embed
@codeblock   | ```
```

---[ Literal ]---

```tm
@em          | *x*
@strikeout   | ~~x~~
@mark        | ==x==
@fence       | `x`
@quote
```

---[ Standard Vocabulary ]---

```tm
@callout
```

